{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is running out and the reactor is on the brink of meltdown. Explore the facility and manipulate the many electrical hazards and locked doors to find a way deeper, towards the source of the problem. Your only tool: a mechanical grabber-arm allowing you to lift and move boxes from afar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think hard, because the reactor core could go into meltdown at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note: </strong><i>The Electrifying Incident</i> is a small, bite-sized experience - about 30-90 minutes for most players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352300/extras/GIF_5.gif?t=1745237644\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short and adorable new adventure from the team behind <i>A Monster\u2019s Expedition </i>and <i>A Good Snowman is Hard to Build</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elegant puzzle design with escalating complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30-90 minutes play time, ideal for a single play session.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Malfunction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3352300/2787fccd9a32cb41c919db4b0685a7bc83e9d9b0.jpg"},{"name":"Find Another Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3352300/4fceb35758711ae4e00d04b4a9d5cb6505fb53d3.jpg"},{"name":"Emergency","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3352300/8f3b1b9f97f3e6e19201334c28a436c8bbdf633f.jpg"},{"name":"Mission Accomplished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3352300/4d6b56bbfbae4ff09f48dc91949f1645888e1d17.jpg"},{"name":"Shocking Behavior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3352300/3a7139ae4d683a3